<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="482636090"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1239706932"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Call of Silence"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="澤野弘之 / R!N/Gemie"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TVアニメ「進撃の巨人」Season 2 オリジナルサウンドトラック"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:58.213"><div begin="00:38.147" end="02:46.895"><p begin="00:38.147" end="00:45.267" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Don't you think 'bout me enough?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你不觉得这对我来说已经足够了吗</span></p><p begin="00:45.848" end="00:53.147" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">I've been burning my heart out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻我的心备受煎熬</span></p><p begin="00:53.649" end="01:00.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Got to face, need to tell you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">必须得面对 告诉你</span></p><p begin="01:01.289" end="01:10.399" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">I won't run 'cause I'm reticent<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝不会逃避 因为我太过沉默寡言</span></p><p begin="01:17.722" end="01:25.022" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Oh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊...</span></p><p begin="01:33.262" end="01:41.222" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊...</span></p><p begin="01:43.962" end="01:51.246" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">You will know you're reborn tonight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会明白今夜你会焕然新生</span></p><p begin="01:51.660" end="01:58.818" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Must be ragged, but I stay by your side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便我衣衫褴褛 我依然会守在你身边</span></p><p begin="01:59.428" end="02:06.918" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">Even if my body's bleached to the bones<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我粉身碎骨</span></p><p begin="02:07.138" end="02:14.158" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">I don't want to go through that ever again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不愿再次经历那样的伤痛</span></p><p begin="02:14.368" end="02:18.004" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">So cry no more<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就请不要再哭泣了 我的爱人</span></p><p begin="02:18.258" end="02:21.338" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Oh, my beloved<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的挚爱</span></p><p begin="02:22.128" end="02:29.379" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Go ahead, be proud and fight it out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢向前吧 骄傲的战斗到底</span></p><p begin="02:29.918" end="02:33.411" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">You are the one<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是那颗冉冉升起的新星</span></p><p begin="02:33.748" end="02:37.037" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Our rising star<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冉冉升起的星</span></p><p begin="02:37.638" end="02:46.895" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">You guide us far to home yet girt<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">指引我们走过遥远漫长的回家之路</span></p></div></body></tt>